"| Codex | `~/.codex/skills/` | [documentație](https://developers.openai.com/codex/skills)\n"
"| Cursor | `~/.cursor/skills/` | [documentație](https://cursor.com/docs/context/skills)\n"
"| IBM Bob | `.bob/skills/` | [documentație](https://bob.ibm.com/docs/ide/features/skills)\n"
